    affiliation: Stobox Technologies
repository-code: https://github.com/StoboxTechnologies/uRWA-Factory
url: https://github.com/StoboxTechnologies/uRWA-Factory
abstract: >-
  An open-source factory for compliant real-world-asset security tokens built
  on ERC-7943 (uRWA). Provides a token with an immutable ledger and a
  replaceable compliance policy layer, a permissionless factory, a pluggable
  identity layer, a rule library covering common regulatory regimes, primary
  offering machinery, and an asset-passport interface with commitment-based
  disclosure. Released in a personal capacity under the MIT licence.
keywords:
  - ERC-7943
  - uRWA
  - real world assets
  - tokenization
  - security token
  - compliance
  - Ethereum
  - Solidity
license: MIT
date-released: '2026-08-15'
